<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-SHEFFIELD SHIELD RESULT.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SHEFFIELD SHIELD RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>HOBART, Australia 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tasmania and Victoria drew on the fourth and final day of their Sheffield Shield cricket match at Bellerive Oval on Monday.</p>
<p>Scores: Victoria 431-9 declared (Dean Jones 145, Laurie Harper 77, David Saker 66 not out) and 204-3 (Ian Harvey 62 not out, Warren Ayres 56); Tasmania 481-8 declared (Michael DiVenuto 119, David Boon 118, Shaun Young 113) and 311-2 declared (Jamie Cox 132, Dene Hills 124 not out).</p>
</text>
